    <briefdescription>
<para>This class allows targets to optionally customize the logic that resolves scheduling class IDs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Targets can use information encoded in <ref refid="classllvm_1_1mca_1_1_instrument" kindref="compound">Instrument</ref> objects to make more informed scheduling decisions. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
